      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the effort to establish harmony and goodwill in the City of New York would be aided by individuals who are trained to assist in preventing and resolving conflicts in their communities and who are prepared to foster understanding and respect among diverse groups within their communities; and",
