        1528,
        1401
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City of New York is home to a multitude of fair-minded individuals willing to act to improve the quality of life in their neighborhoods and in the City as a whole; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.229,
