        1760,
        1526,
        1985
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. a. Establishment of the Mayor's Office for the Increase the Peace Corps. There is hereby established within the Office of the Mayor, the Mayor's Office for the Increase the Peace Corps, to be headed by an Executive Director who shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The Executive Director shall report to and be directly accountable to the Deputy Mayor for Intergovernmental Affairs (Deputy Mayor).",
